<title>GERMANY: Frankfurt air cargo grows 3.2pct in July.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt air cargo grows 3.2pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strong growth in intercontinental exports and imports prompted a 3.2 percent year-on-year rise in air cargo handled at Frankfurt airport in July, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>The strongest-growing routes last month were Eastern Europe, China, Japan and Korea as well as the U.S, the monthly Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG (FAG) traffic report said.</p>
<p>The following table shows cargo handled at Frankfurt airport in July and for the year to date in tonnes and with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>			 July   Pct change   Jan-July  Pct change</p>
<p>    Exports	  64,393  Up 2.8	417,939   Up 2.6</p>
<p>    Imports	  49,944  Up 4.0	356,316   Up 3.2</p>
<p>    Transit	   2,033  Down 5.6     16,116   Up 1.3</p>
<p>    Belly cargo    64,553  Up 3.2	433,211   Up 3.3</p>
<p>    Freighter	49,784  Up 3.4	341,044   Up 2.5</p>
<p>    Total	   116,369  Up 3.2	790,371   Up 2.9</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG, market research dept.</p>
